## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
Run command: `.\gradlew.bat test`
- Build new test suite: `core/src/test/java/com/bpm/minotaur/features/ComprehensiveSystemsOverhaulTest.java` verifying:
  - Exactly 1 `ShopkeeperNpc` spawns per floor in Strata 1 & 2.
  - Merchant AI wanders, defends against monsters, and drops wares/gold upon death.
  - All 15 statue encounter definitions load correctly and offer valid choices.
  - Statues render with proper scale aspect ratio and show dormant text when depleted.
  - Alchemy Cauldron crafts potions using monster organs, bile, and flesh.
  - Inscribing scrolls requires open spell slot and MP, successfully adding to known spells.
  - Altar Arcane Attunement unlocks spell circles and spell slots.
  - Temperature exposure triggers `CHILLED` and `HYPOTHERMIA` below thresholds.

### Manual Verification
- Launch game via `.\gradlew.bat lwjgl3:run`.
- Delve into Strata 1, locate the Traveling Merchant, bump to trade, buy wares using gold and gems.
- Find and interact with a statue; verify billboard aspect, choice resolution, and dormant bump text.
- Gather monster organs, open the Shelter Crafting Screen Tab 4, and brew a Potion of Giant Strength or Fire Resistance.
- Inspect a found spell scroll in the backpack; click `[ INSCRIBE ]` and verify it equips into the spellbook.
- Engage in combat; verify the fast twitchy monster attack indicator (eye flare, lunge, screen slash) and test right-click parrying with a shield.
- Venture out during a Blizzard or heavy snow; observe the frosted screen vignette and verify warming up near a campfire.
